{"data":{"body":"**P1 \u2014 Reserve time for invocation finalization.** This permits scope cleanup to consume all but 50 ms of the remaining Lambda time, while the bundled OTel plugins may spend up to five seconds flushing in `onInvocationEnd()`. A blocked handler can therefore turn PENDING/RETRYING into a Lambda timeout. Derive this budget from an invocation deadline that reserves plugin finalization, manager shutdown, and response time, and add a low-remaining-time test.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc74o_5M","finding_digest":"b78727353d5aca25c4775a25cb6560c3422566901dd25985b99b638626898b56","finding_id":"arf_v1_w6dsonj5llfclrdxlis4wzlayn","finding_key":"sdk/execution/durableexecutor::awaithandlerscopes::finalization-time-budget","identity_key":"sdk/execution/durableexecutor::awaithandlerscopes::finalization-time-budget","line":223,"observation_digest":"790e5b82e82a5359ee8679a22ee8256fe2357e36fdd624b6fc3a8b7d50e4c51f","observation_id":"aro_v1_pehfxaxifjjvt3ugpgrc52bfn7","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/execution/DurableExecutor.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_w6dsonj5llfclrdxlis4wzlayn","published_at":"2026-10-03T03:19:25Z","review_id":"arr_v1_krcjwzvivukssogfxeon2jd46h","reviewed_base_sha":"61f5d103651c2bafc54f840a539cf55a95f47df7","reviewed_head_sha":"be3e03cd4843e1289b8ebafb145890c0aab6e439","reviewer":"codex","start_line":223,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":769},"record_id":"art_v1_kmo3v5w4766dmmyavnbfwbvhxm","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-03T03:19:25Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
